flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open Application]
    B --> C[Load SQLite Database]
    C --> D[Display Product Table and Dashboard Totals]
    D --> E{Select Operation}
    E -->|Add| F[Enter New Product Details]
    E -->|Update| G[Select Product and Edit Details]
    E -->|Delete| H[Select Product to Delete]
    E -->|Exit| Z([End])
    F --> I{Valid Input?}
    G --> I
    I -->|No| J[Show Error Message]
    J --> D
    I -->|Yes| K[Save Changes to Database]
    H --> L{Confirm Delete?}
    L -->|No| D
    L -->|Yes| K
    K --> M[Refresh Table and Dashboard Totals]
    M --> N[Show Success Message]
    N --> D
